  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Nane</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Имя</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">The blacksmith hails you,</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">&quot;What can I do for you today?&quot;</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Кузнец окликает вас,</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">&quot;Чем могу помочь сегодня?&quot;</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"11\" color=\"#330000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Choose a weapon to upgrade. Click nowhere to cancel.</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"Arial\" size=\"11\" color=\"#330000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Выберите оружие для улучшения. Нажмите в другом месте для отмены.</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"15\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Really?</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"15\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Вы уверены?</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"14\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Item Name</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"14\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Название предмета</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Victory! Town falks are overjoyed by the deed you have brought today.</font></p>": "<p align=\"left\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"12\" color=\"#000000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\">Победа! Горожане ликуют, узнав о вашем сегодняшнем подвиге.</font></p>",
  "<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"20\" color=\"#330000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\"><b>Result</b></font></p>": "<p align=\"center\"><font face=\"HGPGyoshotai\" size=\"20\" color=\"#330000\" letterSpacing=\"0.000000\" kerning=\"1\"><b>Итоги</b></font></p>",
